></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>withSlotId</td><td>Pass in the Slot Id that re=
ferred to this ad (you can find it on <a href=3D"https://www.bigossp.com/">=
Bigo Ads platform</a>).</td></tr><tr><td>withAge</td><td>Pass user's age.</=
td></tr><tr><td>withGender</td><td>Pass user's gender. 1:female=EF=BC=8C2:m=
ale</td></tr><tr><td>withActivatedTime</td><td>Pass app's activated timesta=
mp.</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>Next, construct a <code>NativeAdLoader</code> instance and pass in the <=
code>AdLoadListener</code> to receive callbacks from the ad request. Now, c=
all <code>loadAd()</code> method to start a ad request:</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-java"><span class=3D"hljs-type">NativeAdL=
oader</span> <span class=3D"hljs-variable">nativeAdLoader</span> <span clas=
s=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">new</span> <spa=
n class=3D"hljs-title class_">NativeAdLoader</span>.Builder().
        withAdLoadListener(<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">new</span> <span cl=
ass=3D"hljs-title class_">AdLoadListener</span>&lt;NativeAd&gt;() {
