<h2 id=3D"interstitial-ads">Interstitial Ads</h2>
<p>Interstitial ads are full-screen ads. They're typically displayed at nat=
ural transition points in the flow of using an app. When an interstitial ad=
 displays, the user could choose to either tap on the ad to access to its l=
anding page or close it and return to the app.</p>
<h3 id=3D"load-an-ad-2">Load an ad</h3>
<p>Before requesting interstitial ads, please make sure that the Bigo Ads S=
DK has been <a href=3D"https://www.bigossp.com/guide/sdk/android/document#i=
nitialize-the-bigo-ads-sdk">initialized</a>.</p>
<p>To request an interstitial ad, you need to declare a <code>InterstitialA=
d</code> object first:</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-java">InterstitialAd mInterstitialAd;
</code></pre>
<p>And then construct a <code>InterstitialAdRequest</code> instance and pas=
s in the Slot Id:</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-java"><span class=3D"hljs-type">Interstit=
ialAdRequest</span> <span class=3D"hljs-variable">interstitialAdRequest</sp=
an> <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">n=
ew</span> <span class=3D"hljs-title class_">InterstitialAdRequest</span>.Bu=
ilder()
        .withSlotId(<span class=3D"hljs-string">"&lt;your-slot-id&gt;"</spa=
n>)
        .withAge(<span class=3D"hljs-string">"&lt;your-app-user-age&gt;"</s=
pan>)
        .withGender(AdConfig.GENDER_MALE)
        .withActivatedTime(<span class=3D"hljs-string">"&lt;your-app-activa=
ted-timestamp&gt;"</span>)
        .build();
</code></pre>

























