on</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>withSlotId</td><td>Pass in the Slot Id t=
hat referred to this ad (you can find it on <a href=3D"https://www.bigossp.=
com/">Bigo Ads platform</a>).</td></tr><tr><td>withAge</td><td>Pass user's =
age.</td></tr><tr><td>withGender</td><td>Pass user's gender. 1:female=EF=BC=
=8C2:male</td></tr><tr><td>withActivatedTime</td><td>Pass app's activated t=
imestamp.</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>Next, construct an <code>InterstitialAdLoader</code> instance and pass i=
n the <code>AdLoadListener</code> to receive callbacks from the ad request.=
 Now, call <code>loadAd()</code> method to start a ad request:</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-java"><span class=3D"hljs-type">Interstit=
ialAdLoader</span> <span class=3D"hljs-variable">interstitialAdLoader</span=
> <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">new=
</span> <span class=3D"hljs-title class_">InterstitialAdLoader</span>.Build=
er().
        withAdLoadListener(<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">new</span> <span cl=
ass=3D"hljs-title class_">AdLoadListener</span>&lt;InterstitialAd&gt;() {
            <span class=3D"hljs-meta">@Override</span>
            <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class=3D"hljs-=
