Bigo Ads now supports multiple splash ad styles, half-screen and full-scree=
n in vertical and horizontal direction are included. You can find these ad =
styles through <a href=3D"https://www.bigossp.com/">Bigo Ads platform</a> a=
nd use these at your discretion.</p>
