<p>It's recommended to initiate a new ad request during the splash ad displ=
ay, by which means can be well prepared for displaying splash ad when comes=
 to next ad opportunity.</p>
<p>We suggest loading timeout shall be greater than <strong>3000ms</strong>=
 which ensures more ads returned.</p>
<h3 id=3D"display-splash-ad">Display splash ad</h3>
<p>Bigo provides two method displaying a splash ad</p>

















<table><thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Content</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><t=
d><code>show()</code></td><td>This method is akin to displaying interstitia=
l or rewarded ad. Provoke <code>SplashAd.show()</code> method and display a=
 splash ad which is simple. We strongly recommend you to use this method.</=
td></tr><tr><td><code>showInAdContainer(ViewGroup)</code></td><td>This meth=
od aims for publishers who have customized needs to display a splash ad. Pu=
blishers who use this method need construct a ViewGroup,such as FrameLayout=
 or RelativeLayout,then SDK will add splash ad view into this group. This m=
ethod is more complicated than <code>show()</code> method.</td></tr></tbody=
></table>
<p>Below will introduce the two methods</p>
<h4 id=3D"1-show-method">1. <code>show()</code> method</h4>
<p>When a splash ad fills, provoke <code>show()</code> method and display t=
he ad</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-java">mSplashAd.show();
</code></pre>
<blockquote>
<ul>
<li>Each Slot Id can only cache a splash ad at the same time. Repeated requ=
ests at the same time will only return the ad of first success.</li>
<li>In general, one splash ad shall be shown once. Please use the <code>Spl=
ashAd.isExpired()</code> method to identify whether the ad has expired (the=
 validity period of the ad is usually more than 60 minutes) before it is di=
splayed. If an ad has expired, it should be discarded and destroyed, and th=
en request a new one.</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<h4 id=3D"2-showinadcontainerviewgroup-method">2. <code>showInAdContainer(V=
iewGroup)</code> method</h4>
<p>Before displaying splash ads, you shall register ad events listener thro=
ugh the <code>setAdInteractionListener()</code> method once an ad request s=
ucceeds.</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-java">mSplashAd.setAdInteractionListener(=
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class=3D"hljs-title class_">S=
plashAdInteractionListener</span>() { ... });
</code></pre>

































<table><thead><tr><th>SplashAdInteractionListener Callback</th><th>Descript=
ion</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>onAdError</td><td>Indicates that some e=
xceptions occurred during using the ad.</td></tr><tr><td>onAdImpression</td=
><td>Indicates that the ad has been displayed successfully on the device sc=
reen.</td></tr><tr><td>onAdClicked</td><td>Indicates that the ad is clicked=
 by the user.</td></tr><tr><td>onAdSkipped</td><td>Indicates the skip butto=
n is clicked, and the splash ad shall be dismissed immediately.</td></tr><t=
r><td>onAdOpened</td><td>(Splash ads will not trigger this callback.)</td><=
/tr><tr><td>onAdClosed</td><td>(Splash ads will not trigger this callback.)=
</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>Next, call the <code>showInAdContainer()</code> method and pass in <stro=
ng>container view</strong> which is designed for displaying splash ad view<=
/p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-java">mSplashAd.showInAdContainer(contain=
erView);
</code></pre>
<p>To ensure best user experience, <strong>please pass in full screen conta=
iner view</strong>. The ad view provided by Bigo Ads SDK includes some elem=
ents which are significant for ad integration and display, please fully ack=
nowledge these and follow the guidance as following specifications:</p>
<img src=3D"https://static-web.likeevideo.com/as/common-static/big-data/big=
ossp/assets/images/splash_3_en.png" width=3D"360">

































