 be revised on Bigo Ads platform. The countdown will automatically pause wh=
en splash ad is invisibale (such as opening the landing page).</td></tr><tr=
><td>Skip button</td><td>Skip button can be set when it is available to cli=
ck. You can set an appropriate time for displaying skippable button on Bigo=
 Ads platform. When skippable button is clicked, <code>onAdSkipped</code> w=
ill be triggered, and you shall dismiss splash ad.</td></tr><tr><td>Your ap=
p logo</td><td>When you choose to display half-screen style,your app logo s=
