<h2 id=3D"pass-mediation-sdk-info">Pass Mediation SDK Info</h2>
<p>More and more publishers are going to integrate BigoAds SDK, while they =
might using different mediation. We strongly suggest you, as mediation plat=
form, pass mediation info to BigoAds SDK when constructing an ad request, w=
